-- Import the live-site chatbot knowledge base (documents + chunks) analyzed from
-- procurem_chatbot.sql (exported from the live/production support-ai install on
-- 2026-09-13). Only the 'documents' and 'chunks' tables are imported — these are
-- the actual knowledge content (About/Advisory/Products/Contact/Privacy Policy/
-- procurement-law guidance/important links, all directly about procurementhub.sa,
-- in both English and Arabic). 'answer_cache' from that export is intentionally
-- excluded: it is a derived Q&A cache keyed to a kb_version, safely regenerated by
-- the app on first use — not knowledge-base content.
--
-- Safe to run once against a fresh/empty support_ai database (agent_id=1 must
-- already exist — the default install seeds it). Re-running after documents/chunks
-- already exist would duplicate rows (plain INSERT, explicit IDs preserved to keep
-- document_id references in chunks intact).

SET NAMES utf8mb4;


